# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# the machine's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier defaults to LF endings
# (.prettierrc has no endOfLine override); on Windows with core.autocrlf=true,
# git would otherwise rewrite every file to CRLF on checkout and break
# `npm run format:check` on a clean clone. See docs/decisions.md (2026-09-23,
# line endings).
* text=auto eol=lf
